---
<BaseLayout title="Seoul Café Chain — 12 Locations Standardized on JD-3 | JD-3 Case Study" description="Seoul Café Chain — 12 Locations Standardized on JD-3 — case study of a V-TAI JD-3 deployment." locale={locale} canonicalPath="/case-studies/seoul-cafe-chain/" schemaType="Article">
<BreadcrumbNav items={[{label:'Home',href:'/th/'},{label:'Case Studies',href:'/th/case-studies/'},{label:'Seoul Café Chain — 12 Locations Standardized on JD-3'}]} />
<section class="section"><div class="container-prose">
<h1 class="mb-4">Seoul Café Chain — 12 Locations Standardized on JD-3</h1>
<p class="text-lg mb-6">Real bakery deployment of the V-TAI JD-3 hood-type bakery tray washer.</p>
<p class="text-bakery-navy/70 mb-4">For the full English version with detailed metrics, visit <a href="/case-studies/seoul-cafe-chain/" class="underline">/case-studies/seoul-cafe-chain/</a>.</p>
<h2 class="mt-8 mb-3">Background</h2>
<p>Anonymized customer deployment showing the JD-3 in real-world operation. Specific metrics, payback period, and operational outcomes are documented in the full English case study.</p>
<h2 class="mt-8 mb-3">Why JD-3</h2>
<ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
<li>600×400 mm tray compatibility (when applicable)</li>
